# Per-prospect audit reports and pitch pages. These moved to the
# builder-owned groundwork-reports project (reports.groundworkdental.com)
# in #11. public/_redirects keeps previously-sent links working — but a
# file here would shadow those rules, since Cloudflare Pages serves static
# assets in preference to _redirects. Ignored so a stray pipeline run
# can't silently break the migration.
public/audits/
public/pitch/

# Playwright MCP scratch output (screenshots, snapshots)
.playwright-mcp/
